  "limitations": [
    "Characters are flattened PNG poses, NOT rigged limb-by-limb animation models. Use CSS/GSAP transform-based idle movement.",
    "Small comic accents or disconnected fragments near sprites might be excluded by component isolation. Inspect each crop before final release.",
    "Skyline and rooftop are independently provided layers, but generated artwork is not perspective-aligned to the full city panorama; test parallax composition visually.",
    "Some generated asset sheets contain built-in labels. UI elements must be recreated as editable HTML/SVG rather than cropping text from the UI reference.",
    "No voiceover audio included. Use approved user-supplied recordings; a silent timing demo is okay and must be labeled as such.",
    "Visual consistency is an approved concept, but model-generated pose sheets are not pixel-perfect model sheets. Final art QA required.",
    "This kit contains pilot scene assets; art for the remaining chapters and all adversary characters is not included."
  ]
